!.env.example

# Out-of-repo scratch area: a telephony/LiveKit spike with its own Node toolchain,
# lockfile, and dependencies. It is not part of the JARVIS control plane, its
# contents are third-party `node_modules` trees, and it carries its own nested
# `.gitignore` and `.env`. Excluded wholesale so nothing from it can be published
# accidentally by a broad `git add`. This only prevents untracked files from being
# added; it does not make the directory invisible to repository tooling, which is
# handled separately.
docs/research-telephony/